It's fine.

101
00:04:39,920 --> 00:04:41,280
Like this...

102
00:04:41,280 --> 00:04:42,080
(Still recovering)
It's okay.

103
00:04:42,080 --> 00:04:44,040
(Back to work mode)
They wander around the office at night.

104
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,160
When we first joined the company,
we were all normal humans.

105
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:50,200
But after working here,

106
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:53,080
