107
00:04:56,140 --> 00:04:56,700
(Work mode)

108
00:04:56,700 --> 00:04:57,600
(Scared mode)

109
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,680
For example,

110
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,720
there is a type of employee

111
00:04:59,720 --> 00:05:02,060
