113
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:07,040
The "capybara-type employee"?

114
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:09,600
Who is it?

115
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:11,560
Who is it?

116
00:05:12,120 --> 00:05:13,840
It's me.

117
00:05:16,200 --> 00:05:17,960
My workplace survival rule is

118
00:05:18,680 --> 00:05:19,960
"I know you're in a hurry

119
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:20,920
but don't panic yet."

120
00:05:21,600 --> 00:05:23,640
Take it slow.

121
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,760
Things will go wrong anyway.

122
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:27,520
Don't take things too seriously.

123
00:05:27,520 --> 00:05:28,480
Don't overthink.

124
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:29,200
Don't put your heart into it.

125
00:05:31,620 --> 00:05:32,660
(Tui Games Company, He Struggle,
Famous Motion Capture Artist)

126
00:05:32,660 --> 00:05:33,740
