137
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:57,560
The "puppy-type employee" is me.

138
00:05:57,840 --> 00:06:00,480
My workplace survival rule is

139
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,160
"Yes, boss",

140
00:06:03,160 --> 00:06:04,160
"You're right, boss",

141
00:06:04,160 --> 00:06:05,680
