142
00:06:05,680 --> 00:06:06,640
The main point is

143
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:07,480
having a great attitude

144
00:06:07,480 --> 00:06:08,880
at work so that

145
00:06:08,880 --> 00:06:10,600
