Official Coser & Sales)

147
00:06:12,380 --> 00:06:13,500
(Puppy-type employee
workplace survival rule)

148
00:06:13,500 --> 00:06:14,580
("Yes, boss." "You're right, boss."
"That's amazing, boss.")

149
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:15,800
There's also...

150
00:06:16,220 --> 00:06:18,300
(Witnessing the entire scary incident)

151
00:06:21,480 --> 00:06:22,560
What's wrong?

152
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,520
Nothing.

153
00:06:23,520 --> 00:06:25,040
Let's continue with the urban legend.

154
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:26,300
(It's okay, it's okay.)

155
00:06:27,200 --> 00:06:28,000
There's also

156
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:30,400
another type

157
00:06:30,400 --> 00:06:32,260
known as

158
00:06:32,880 --> 00:06:34,750
