159
00:06:35,400 --> 00:06:37,960
My workplace survival rule is

160
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:40,320
"I don't know."

161
00:06:40,560 --> 00:06:42,800
"I'm not doing this."

162
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:45,240
"When trouble comes, I'll avoid it."

163
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:47,680
"When I see problems,"

164
