300
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:34,000
Find... my... body.

301
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:34,680
What?

302
00:11:34,680 --> 00:11:35,360
Find the body.

303
00:11:37,440 --> 00:11:39,800
Who can help me? Help me find my body.

304
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:41,280
Are you a dog?

305
00:11:41,280 --> 00:11:41,760
Yes.

306
00:11:41,760 --> 00:11:42,840
Sniff.

307
00:11:42,840 --> 00:11:44,200
Sniff this out.

308
00:11:44,800 --> 00:11:46,560
Good. Now go.

309
00:11:46,560 --> 00:11:47,280
Where is he?

310
00:11:50,480 --> 00:11:51,600
I don't have that skill.

311
00:11:51,920 --> 00:11:52,720
Sorry.

312
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:53,380
(Surprisingly polite)

313
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:55,720
No. This proves one thing.

314
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:59,560
The company urban legends
we talked about are real.

315
00:12:00,040 --> 00:12:01,840
(Story setting:
Contains fictional horror elements)

316
