335
00:12:45,000 --> 00:12:46,760
Thank you all for coming
to the Crazy Animal Theme Party.

336
00:12:46,760 --> 00:12:48,280
(Tui Games Company Boss, Tui Haowan,
Played by Lanlan)

337
00:12:48,520 --> 00:12:51,480
Our first exciting event, the urban
legend sharing session, begins now.

338
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:54,560
(Crazy Animal Theme Party "Let's Party
Like This" 2:30PM Officially Starts)

339
00:12:54,560 --> 00:12:55,160
