You killed him.

369
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:47,080
(Why wait?)
You killed him.

370
00:13:47,320 --> 00:13:47,720
No.

371
00:13:47,740 --> 00:13:48,780
(Innocent)

372
00:13:50,280 --> 00:13:51,160
Ning Watcha knows the truth.

373
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:52,400
Is this the boss's leg?

374
00:13:52,400 --> 00:13:53,680
That's right.

375
00:13:53,680 --> 00:13:54,520
This square-shaped scar

376
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:56,160
