388
00:14:12,560 --> 00:14:13,560
Absolutely not.

389
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:15,840
After we burned him...

390
00:14:15,840 --> 00:14:16,840
Alright. Let's vote.

391
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:18,480
The boss invited us
to join this urban legend event too.

392
00:14:18,540 --> 00:14:20,860
