399
00:14:31,160 --> 00:14:32,280
Our stomachs were really upset.

400
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:34,040
Probably because the company food
was contaminated.

401
00:14:34,100 --> 00:14:35,860
(Ridiculous)

402
00:14:36,160 --> 00:14:38,560
If that's what you two are saying,

403
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:40,520
