Reveal the truth.

423
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:15,880
(Identify the real suspect)
Find the culprit.

424
00:15:17,940 --> 00:15:21,620
Case 8: Revenge in Animal City)

425
00:15:21,640 --> 00:15:25,680
I'll go take care of our VIP,

426
00:15:26,600 --> 00:15:28,720
