449
00:16:08,240 --> 00:16:08,720
Loyal.

450
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:09,120
Yeah, loyal.

451
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:13,240
Time to investigate.

452
00:16:13,240 --> 00:16:14,040
No problem.

453
00:16:14,040 --> 00:16:15,720
(The Truth Online's reminder)
Let's search the room.

454
00:16:15,720 --> 00:16:16,760
(Dramatic use only)
Check out this foot.

455
00:16:17,200 --> 00:16:18,360
(Do not imitate)
Wear gloves before touching it.

456
00:16:18,360 --> 00:16:20,200
Or you might get athlete's foot.

457
00:16:20,200 --> 00:16:21,720
Too late. We already touched it.

458
00:16:21,720 --> 00:16:22,440
(Bad example)

459
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:23,080
Don't touch me later.

460
00:16:23,080 --> 00:16:23,360
Well.

461
00:16:25,960 --> 00:16:28,200
We've already confirmed

462
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:30,960
