474
00:16:59,480 --> 00:17:00,200
For example.

475
00:17:00,360 --> 00:17:02,440
Tui Games makes such amazing games.

476
00:17:02,440 --> 00:17:04,320
How can anyone compete?

477
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,360
But on the back it says,

478
00:17:09,600 --> 00:17:12,880
