479
00:17:13,160 --> 00:17:13,880
Here's another one.

480
00:17:13,880 --> 00:17:15,200
Tui Games Company.

481
00:17:15,480 --> 00:17:17,440
Every Tui game is a masterpiece.

482
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:19,480
