486
00:17:25,800 --> 00:17:28,120
So who acted best just now?

487
00:17:28,440 --> 00:17:29,080
You.

488
00:17:29,840 --> 00:17:30,560
You've been acting all along.

489
00:17:31,320 --> 00:17:31,880
The killer.

490
00:17:31,880 --> 00:17:32,600
Exactly.

491
00:17:32,840 --> 00:17:34,560
You think I'm acting?

492
00:17:34,840 --> 00:17:36,280
(Mermaid's temptation)
I'm always like this.

493
00:17:39,080 --> 00:17:41,840
Why do you always talk like that?

494
00:17:43,680 --> 00:17:44,960
Tui Games Company,

495
00:17:44,960 --> 00:17:47,120
