496
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:47,680
What's on the back?

497
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:49,360
Never attend the monthly

498
00:17:49,360 --> 00:17:50,400
Crazy Animal Theme Party.

499
00:17:50,400 --> 00:17:52,920
Everyone who went disappeared.

500
00:17:52,940 --> 00:17:54,680
(Everyone who attended disappeared?)

501
00:17:54,680 --> 00:17:55,600
Everyone who went...

502
00:17:56,360 --> 00:17:58,480
I even saw several employees' bodies.

503
00:17:59,080 --> 00:18:02,520
The Tui City urban legend is real.

504
00:18:02,520 --> 00:18:03,920
It's real.

505
00:18:06,320 --> 00:18:09,120
The urban legend is true.

506
00:18:09,380 --> 00:18:12,220
(What secret
is Tui Games Company hiding?)

507
00:18:15,560 --> 00:18:16,360
Take it.

508
00:18:16,360 --> 00:18:17,280
Nan Shy, take it.

509
00:18:18,220 --> 00:18:19,040
(How to break
the urban legend "Who Can Help Me?")

510
00:18:19,040 --> 00:18:21,120
Here, Nan Shy just found this.

511
00:18:21,120 --> 00:18:22,280
How to break

512
00:18:22,280 --> 00:18:25,840
the urban legend "Who Can Help Me?"

513
00:18:25,840 --> 00:18:28,200
If you fail the dead person's request,

514
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:30,400
