520
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:43,280
You'll escape for a while.

521
00:18:43,600 --> 00:18:44,360
This is the cabinet.

522
00:18:45,600 --> 00:18:47,160
Look, it's marked with leaves.

523
00:18:47,160 --> 00:18:48,720
Look, that one has it too.

524
00:18:48,720 --> 00:18:50,050
(1, 2, 3)
One, two, three,

525
00:18:50,050 --> 00:18:51,230
(4, 5, 6)
four, five, six.

526
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:52,440
Exactly six lockers.

527
00:18:52,680 --> 00:18:54,520
Each of us takes one.

528
00:18:55,020 --> 00:18:57,120
(Curious little rabbit)

529
00:18:57,120 --> 00:18:57,840
So we can't look yet?

530
00:18:59,040 --> 00:18:59,920
Is this little rabbit?

531
00:19:00,640 --> 00:19:02,360
She's really curious.

532
00:19:02,380 --> 00:19:03,640
(Curious little rabbit
scouts an escape route)

533
00:19:03,640 --> 00:19:05,320
Better check first,
so we can hide later.

534
00:19:06,760 --> 00:19:07,920
Did you find my hand?

535
00:19:09,000 --> 00:19:10,640
If not,

536
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:12,320
I'll take yours.

537
00:19:12,320 --> 00:19:13,920
I'm coming to find you.

538
00:19:13,920 --> 00:19:14,720
It's okay.

539
00:19:16,120 --> 00:19:17,000
What does that mean?

540
00:19:17,020 --> 00:19:18,180
(Night vision mode)

541
00:19:18,180 --> 00:19:19,980
(Punching the air. Bring it on!)

542
00:19:20,320 --> 00:19:22,360
So we can't find the body?

543
00:19:22,360 --> 00:19:23,080
Of course not.

544
00:19:23,080 --> 00:19:24,440
We have to give it our hands.

545
00:19:24,460 --> 00:19:26,000
(That's generous)

546
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:27,080
But if we hide inside,

547
00:19:27,080 --> 00:19:28,560
