1735
00:55:17,080 --> 00:55:17,880
He's still human.

1736
00:55:17,920 --> 00:55:18,800
He's still human.

1737
00:55:18,820 --> 00:55:20,220
(Work in progress)

1738
00:55:20,480 --> 00:55:22,040
Spends most of his time eating.

1739
00:55:22,040 --> 00:55:22,840
That does sound like him.

1740
00:55:22,840 --> 00:55:23,840
