1741
00:55:23,840 --> 00:55:24,520
Yeah.

1742
00:55:24,580 --> 00:55:36,300
(Still eating)

1743
00:55:36,680 --> 00:55:37,760
Definitely that vibe.

1744
00:55:37,760 --> 00:55:38,920
He just keeps eating.

1745
00:55:38,920 --> 00:55:41,560
Their calls include barking,
squealing, and whistling.

1746
00:55:41,560 --> 00:55:43,440
Lately, he's started whistling

1747
