to me.

1748
00:55:48,960 --> 00:55:49,720
Just like that.

1749
00:55:50,960 --> 00:55:51,840
I get it now.

1750
00:55:51,840 --> 00:55:54,640
So when he turns into an animal,

1751
00:55:54,640 --> 00:55:56,440
