1863
00:58:41,680 --> 00:58:44,280
(1. Everyone was originally an animal)
It turns people like us into animals.

1864
00:58:44,280 --> 00:58:45,440
(2. Company turns people into animals)
Once we're animals,

1865
00:58:45,440 --> 00:58:46,720
