Yes.

1867
00:58:47,960 --> 00:58:49,000
There's one more possibility.

1868
00:58:49,000 --> 00:58:50,040
We're actually animals.

1869
00:58:50,040 --> 00:58:51,600
We just think we're human.

1870
00:58:51,700 --> 00:58:52,560
