1880
00:59:05,400 --> 00:59:06,080
(Nan Shy's motive:)
What's the second one?

1881
00:59:06,080 --> 00:59:07,360
(1. He Struggle was abused by Tui)
She wanted to escape the company.

1882
00:59:07,380 --> 00:59:09,080
(2. She failed to escape with He
and wanted to kill Tui before leaving)

1883
00:59:09,080 --> 00:59:09,440
Alright.

1884
00:59:09,640 --> 00:59:10,840
Let's head to Ke's place.

1885
