1894
00:59:23,380 --> 00:59:24,100
(Returning)

1895
00:59:24,120 --> 00:59:25,560
Is there any key evidence here?

1896
00:59:25,720 --> 00:59:26,680
Key evidence?

1897
00:59:27,560 --> 00:59:28,760
I've been watching closely

1898
00:59:28,760 --> 00:59:29,680
(Unlock the team's best moments early)
