1906
00:59:39,660 --> 00:59:41,740
(Break room)

1907
00:59:46,380 --> 00:59:48,340
(New area unlocked: Break room)

1908
00:59:54,680 --> 00:59:55,880
Look at your tiny bones.

1909
00:59:55,980 --> 00:59:57,300
