contains horror elements)

1923
01:00:15,480 --> 01:00:16,240
You were absolutely right.

1924
01:00:16,240 --> 01:00:17,160
It's about humans.

1925
01:00:17,720 --> 01:00:18,880
This is

1926
01:00:19,640 --> 01:00:22,400
