1927
01:00:23,580 --> 01:00:27,380
(This is revenge against humanity)

1928
01:00:28,080 --> 01:00:29,040
I think this thing moves.

1929
01:00:31,880 --> 01:00:32,760
It definitely moves.

1930
01:00:32,760 --> 01:00:33,280
Press it.

1931
01:00:33,280 --> 01:00:33,800
(Taking it apart)

1932
01:00:33,800 --> 01:00:34,280
Don't!

1933
01:00:34,280 --> 01:00:36,000
