2910
01:30:25,680 --> 01:30:26,360
So what now?

2911
01:30:26,360 --> 01:30:27,400
Still pretending?

2912
01:30:27,400 --> 01:30:28,240
Vote for me?

2913
01:30:28,240 --> 01:30:29,320
Here we go again.

2914
01:30:29,320 --> 01:30:30,200
Then this round,

2915
01:30:30,200 --> 01:30:31,920
I'll leave it to you all.

2916
01:30:31,920 --> 01:30:32,960
It's up to you to decide.

